# PR-012: Selectively dissolve carbonate from a mixed mineral precipitate
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CaCO3 0.001mol
add v1 BaCl2 0.0005mol
add v1 Na2SO4 0.0005mol
inspect v1
add v1 HCl 0.003mol
new
filter v1 v2
inspect
